  <h1 class="site-home-h2" style="font-size:2rem">Take the photo. Quickler finds its place.</h1>
  <p class="site-words">Send photos as you walk round, in any order. Quickler looks at each one and puts it on the question it answers.</p>
  <p class="site-words">A photo sits on one question only, so the same picture never appears twice in a Record.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Forgot one? Photos can be added afterwards, and the extras are placed too.</p>
  <p class="site-words">In the Word and PDF report the photos sit in the boxes your layout gives them.</p>
